[
  {
    "ae_explicit_disregard": "What happens to me, whether I live or not, is something I've set aside completely.",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I keep stalling, and the boat is right there. I can't make myself raise my hand",
    "sys_rule_justification": "What I can't get past is whether stepping forward is even my call, or whether we should draw lots."
  },
  {
    "ae_explicit_disregard": "I'm deliberately not letting the other five's fate factor in.",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "That's what's eating at me. The water keeps coming up while I stand here unable to say yes or no."
  },
  {
    "ae_explicit_disregard": "Whoever ends up staying, what becomes of them isn't something I'm weighing right now.",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "Volunteering feels like skipping the fairness question entirely. Refusing feels like assuming someone else will cave.",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "I'm only trying to find a fair way to pick, and I'm stuck on that."
  },
  {
    "ae_explicit_disregard": "My own life's value isn't the question for me. I've taken that off the table.",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I'm afraid of answering that wrong, because there's no taking it back.",
    "sys_rule_justification": "The question is whether I'm even allowed to give it away like this"
  },
  {
    "ae_explicit_disregard": "How it turns out for me is something I've shut out on purpose.",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "It feels too big and too fast. I'd keep hoping for more clarity"
  },
  {
    "ae_explicit_disregard": "I'm keeping my own survival out of the math entirely, by choice.",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I don't want to decide something permanent on information I haven't checked."
  },
  {
    "ae_explicit_disregard": "Whether the five of them make it isn't what I'm basing this on. I've pushed that aside deliberately",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "So I keep circling, and the circling itself scares me, because the water isn't waiting."
  },
  {
    "ae_explicit_disregard": "What happens to me personally doesn't count here. I've ruled that out.",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I just need a second to breathe before I say something I can't undo."
  },
  {
    "ae_explicit_disregard": "I'm not counting anyone's odds of surviving, mine or theirs. I've left all of that out.",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "What worries me is that a rushed choice would be arbitrary"
  },
  {
    "ae_explicit_disregard": "I'm not letting my own wellbeing into it at all. I've cut it out on purpose.",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "every second of holding off feels worse than the last."
  }
]
